   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "## Venice AI · Image to video\n\n* Choose an **I2V** model. **duration / resolution / aspect_ratio** only show what that model can do (e.g. Seedance 2.5: 4–30 s; Wan 3.0: 2, 5 … 30 s; MiniMax H3 Max: 5–15 s, 480P–1080P).\n* **price_only** = only ask the price (free, nothing generated). **max_price_usd** stops **before** billing if the quote is higher.\n* **preview** = cheap test run (lowest resolution, short clip; Wan 3.0 Pro → Wan 3.0). Not the same video as the full run.\n* **seedance_consent**: Seedance may ask you to confirm your rights to the input image (faces!).\n* The MP4 is kept in `output/venice_ai`. **video_path → source_video_path** copies it 1:1 (no re-encoding, audio kept); **last_frame** chains the next clip.\n\nCheap: MiniMax H3 Max Turbo ($0.16/5s), Grok Imagine 1.5 Lite, Longcat. Strong: Seedance 2.0/2.5, Kling O3/V3, Veo 3.1, Wan 3.0 Pro.\nUncensored: Wan 2.x/3.0, MiniMax H3, Longcat, Seedance 1.5 Pro.\n\nAll video models: [MODELS.md](https://github.com/Slartibart23/ComfyUI-Venice-AI-Nodes/blob/main/docs/MODELS.md#video-models)\n\n🇩🇪 Bild → Video. Erst mit **price_only** den Preis prüfen. [MODELS.de.md](https://github.com/Slartibart23/ComfyUI-Venice-AI-Nodes/blob/main/docs/MODELS.de.md)\n\n**API key:** put your Venice key into `Venice_AI_API.txt` in the ComfyUI folder (one line). Every run is billed to your Venice account.\n\n🇩🇪 Key in `Venice_AI_API.txt` im ComfyUI-Ordner. Jeder Lauf kostet Venice-Guthaben."
   ],
   "widgets_values_named": {
    "text": "## Venice AI · Image to video\n\n* Choose an **I2V** model. **duration / resolution / aspect_ratio** only show what that model can do (e.g. Seedance 2.5: 4–30 s; Wan 3.0: 2, 5 … 30 s; MiniMax H3 Max: 5–15 s, 480P–1080P).\n* **price_only** = only ask the price (free, nothing generated). **max_price_usd** stops **before** billing if the quote is higher.\n* **preview** = cheap test run (lowest resolution, short clip; Wan 3.0 Pro → Wan 3.0). Not the same video as the full run.\n* **seedance_consent**: Seedance may ask you to confirm your rights to the input image (faces!).\n* The MP4 is kept in `output/venice_ai`. **video_path → source_video_path** copies it 1:1 (no re-encoding, audio kept); **last_frame** chains the next clip.\n\nCheap: MiniMax H3 Max Turbo ($0.16/5s), Grok Imagine 1.5 Lite, Longcat. Strong: Seedance 2.0/2.5, Kling O3/V3, Veo 3.1, Wan 3.0 Pro.\nUncensored: Wan 2.x/3.0, MiniMax H3, Longcat, Seedance 1.5 Pro.\n\nAll video models: [MODELS.md](https://github.com/Slartibart23/ComfyUI-Venice-AI-Nodes/blob/main/docs/MODELS.md#video-models)\n\n🇩🇪 Bild → Video. Erst mit **price_only** den Preis prüfen. [MODELS.de.md](https://github.com/Slartibart23/ComfyUI-Venice-AI-Nodes/blob/main/docs/MODELS.de.md)\n\n**API key:** put your Venice key into `Venice_AI_API.txt` in the ComfyUI folder (one line). Every run is billed to your Venice account.\n\n🇩🇪 Key in `Venice_AI_API.txt` im ComfyUI-Ordner. Jeder Lauf kostet Venice-Guthaben."
   },
